{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/EN1.png?t=1737118574\" /><br>\u2014Mr. C, CEO of world-famous VTuber Kuripa's agency, has been brutally murdered. Possible suspects have been whittled down to one of the agency's six employees, three of which claim to be Kuripa's &quot;real face,&quot; saying they were streaming as Kuripa during Mr. C's murder\u2014the perfect alibi! As Prosecutor Justin Truth, it is your job to uncover the lies and find Mr. C's killer!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/GifEN.gif?t=1737118574\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/EN2.png?t=1737118574\" /><br>As prosecutor, it's up to you to question all possible suspects, uncover conflicts in their statements, and determine the outcome of the case. After collecting enough evidence, players can make their final decision on who to prosecute.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/Gif1EN.gif?t=1737118574\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/EN3.png?t=1737118574\" /><br>With proper questioning, guide friendly witnesses to provide testimony favorable to the prosecution. Present evidence to reveal weaknesses, undermine the credibility of hostile witnesses, and win victory in the courtroom!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/Gif2EN.gif?t=1737118574\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/EN4.png?t=1737118574\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/Stea